<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Thursday's Dutch first division soccer match:</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 2 (Stam 45, Marcelo 65) Sparta Rotterdam 1 (Van der Hoeven 10). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 26,900.</p>
